OL,3,GNEWSAWhy women have rallied behind rape
OL,4,Avictim Joanne Young                    
OL,6,FWhen Joanne Young waived her anonymity 
OL,7,Fand spoke publicly about being drugged,
OL,8,Fraped and advertised online for sex by 
OL,9,Fher husband, her story struck a chord  
OL,10,Fwith women across the UK.              
OL,12,FSome travelled for hours to support her
OL,13,Fduring a trial described by one expert 
OL,14,Fas part of a wider "resurgence in      
OL,15,Fsolidarity" with survivors of sexual   
OL,16,Fviolence.                              
OL,18,FOthers followed proceedings closely,   
OL,19,Fdrawing comparisons with the public    
OL,20,Fsupport shown to French survivor Gisele
OL,21,FPelicot during her rape trial.         
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
